              <img
                alt="Reserva"
                class="mx-auto h-20 object-contain mb-6"
                src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=elegant%20restaurant%20reservation%20icon%2C%20golden%20cutlery%20symbol%2C%20fine%20dining%20booking%20illustration%2C%20professional%20restaurant%20branding%20element&width=135&height=176&seq=reservation-icon&orientation=portrait"
              /><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">
                Haz tu reserva
              </h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">
                Lunes a domingos: 13:00 - 00:00
              </p><a
                href="tel:+34622415004"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white px-8 py-4 text-lg"
                >LLAMAR</a
